      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've heard concerns that this would be \"confusing\" for new players. I suggest a new component or an option inside VRC_Station that would allow or disallow sitting in your own chair. This is some great untapped potential that I'd hate to see wasted.\n\nFor example, you could make vehicles that not only other players could ride in, but also yourself.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
